WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.700
Japan's AI plan, in draft: eight in ten of
us using AI. Who are the other two?

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:10.367
Tokyo Toko's twenties: 78% already use it.

00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:15.033
All ages: 58.8%. The target: 80%.

00:00:15.733 --> 00:00:19.700
The survey was online. The farmhouse
wasn't asked.

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:26.000
EIGHT IN TEN. THE OTHER TWO ARE HAVING
TEA.
